  "track.debugging.vz.ly.note.guess.0": "Tap the centre of the button: nothing.",
  "track.debugging.vz.ly.note.guess.1": "Add Log.d to onClick: nothing prints.",
  "track.debugging.vz.ly.note.guess.2": "The button grows to 64 dp (table below); the tap still lands on the overlay.",
  "track.debugging.vz.ly.note.guess.3": "Nobody has looked at the UI tree; the overlay is still there.",
  "track.debugging.vz.ly.note.inspect.0": "Select the region at the tap point: the outlined rows are under it.",
